  (text "Firmware drives PE5 high after launch detect; R1014 charges C1007 in about 0.5 s. If PE5 lets go\n(a reset aloft), C1007 keeps BAT_SHDN_N and, through J102.8, Churro's AV_SHDN_N above 2 V for\n>=0.75 s at the worst corner, against the ~0.6 s a restart and re-assert take (D-2Nov.4, D-2Nov.18).\nR1015 keeps PE5 low at reset. U101 MODE to GND: auto-retry after an overload (D-6.3)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 139.7 416.56 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.016 1.016))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "f7c12ec8-dfb6-5f22-aa3c-241abe1f7705"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
  (text "2S ENTRY / EXCLUSIVE SOURCE"
