  (text "What this does: Accepts one 2S battery source, blocks reverse connection, shuts down a faulty input and retries,\nand holds the battery enable on through a flight-computer reset aloft (FC_POWER_HOLD).\nConnects to: Standalone battery or Foinse mate -> battery monitor shunt -> logic and output branches. The external switch is on 44-master-enable.\nENERGY_TAP (Q101 drain, ahead of the eFuse) -> output arm feeds on 06*, battery-monitor VBUS on 07a."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "b714c4f9-1803-53d9-9417-2b49e6a54fd1")))
